/* meow-ios — Burmese (my) localization.

   Key set is 1:1 with en.lproj — every key in en.lproj/Localizable.strings
   appears here, in the same order. Strings deliberately omitted from en.lproj
   (QA/OCR harness pins, stable diagnostic reason codes, internal chart
   bindings, log-level Picker .tag() values) must NOT be added here either —
   see en.lproj header for the exclusion list.

   Terminology follows meow-android values-my (mobile + core), e.g.
   ပရောက်စီ (proxy), စည်းမျဉ်း (rule), တိုက်ရိုက် (direct), Global,
   ကြန့်ကြာချိန် (latency), ဒေတာ အသွားအလာ (traffic). "Config", "Host",
   "payload" and "Tunnel" stay in Latin script, as on Android.

   Style:
     - Standard Unicode Myanmar script in canonical storage order, never Zawgyi.
     - Buttons / toolbar items use the short "…ရန်" imperative form
       (ထည့်ရန် / သိမ်းရန် / ပိတ်ရန်); Cancel is မလုပ်တော့, as on Android.
     - Western digits are kept exactly as in en.lproj (443, 204, 7).
     - Ellipsis is the single character "…" (U+2026), matching en.lproj. */


